  "Raw exports are local and Git-ignored under data/raw/step06_string/poster_api/: mapping TSVs, full evidence-channel network TSVs, functional annotation TSVs, reference FASTA sequences, stable network-link TSVs, exact UniProt cross-references, and two native STRING PNGs. STRING_49_and_67_API_exports.zip bundles those public-resource exports. Reference FASTA coordinates must not be substituted for JE2 phosphosite coordinates.","",
  "Functional annotation exports aggregate inputGenes per term (1,082 terms for49;1,235 for67). They are membership records, not new ORA/GSEA significance tests. Every gene token was checked against its input set, counts match the tokens, and all49/67 nodes are represented. API request URLs, original retrieval times, HTTP status and cache-hit flags are recorded. Reruns reuse matching current-session responses without inventing new retrieval times.","",
  "Derived node/edge/membership CSVs and plot coordinates are in this report folder. Native website coordinates were not claimed: the exported poster positions are our explicitly designed layout. [API provenance](API_provenance.csv), [native-image provenance](native_image_export_provenance.csv), [raw-export checksums](raw_export_inventory.csv), and [layout checks](poster_geometry_checks.csv) document the handoff.","",
  "## Reproduce","",
